WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.302
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.769
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:06.072
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:09.041
President Biden hosted
a state dinner tonight

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:12.378
for Australian prime minister
Anthony Albanese,

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:14.947
and the menu included
butternut squash soup

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:16.316
and roasted beet salad,

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:19.052
which is weird because
I was under the impression

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:21.154
that Australia was our ally.

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:23.156
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.257 --> 00:00:26.860
[ Australian accent ]
Beet salad?

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.428
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:32.765
[ Normal voice ] The House
of Representatives voted today

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:35.200
to elect Louisiana congressman
Mike Johnson

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.535
Speaker of the House,

00:00:36.535 --> 00:00:40.073
and apparently this
election result he will accept.

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:41.340
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.742
That's right, Republicans today

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:44.511
elected Mike Johnson
Speaker of the House.

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:47.446
Wow, the speaker race
was so embarrassing,

00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:51.317
they're not even giving
their real names anymore.

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:53.086
Mike Johnson is the name
you give

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:56.990
when you check in to a motel
with your mistress.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.158
That's what Spirit Halloween

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:01.728
calls their
Michael Jackson costume.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.296
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:07.867
During the second secret ballot

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:10.102
in last night's closed-door
Republican conference meeting,

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:11.671
former House Speaker
Kevin McCarthy

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:14.173
reportedly received
33 of the 34 votes

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:17.042
cast against Speaker designate
Mike Johnson.

00:01:17.042 --> 00:01:20.213
Got to admit, it would have been
pretty funny if, after all this,

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:22.915
Republicans had landed
back on McCarthy.

00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:25.551
Would be like matching
with your ex-wife on Tinder.

00:01:25.551 --> 00:01:28.555
"What? We have a lot in common.

00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:31.924
Our children, for example."

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:34.326
Trump 2020 campaign lawyer
Jenna Ellis

00:01:34.326 --> 00:01:35.728
pleaded guilty yesterday

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:38.297
to a criminal charge
in the Georgia election case

00:01:38.297 --> 00:01:40.866
and cried while expressing
regret for her actions.

00:01:40.866 --> 00:01:44.103
Wow, pretty stark contrast
from her mug shot.

00:01:44.103 --> 00:01:46.873
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:49.441
This photo looks like
she also needed one

00:01:49.441 --> 00:01:50.676
for her Christmas card

00:01:50.676 --> 00:01:53.112
and didn't want
to make two stops.

00:01:53.112 --> 00:01:54.914
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:56.348
In his testimony yesterday

00:01:56.348 --> 00:01:58.284
at former president Trump's
civil fraud trial,

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:01.187
ex-lawyer Michael Cohen said
whatever issues Trump had,

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:04.457
he "would bring it to me
in order to resolve,"

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:07.660
which explains why Cohen
always carried a plunger.

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.995
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.995 --> 00:02:11.331
Yeah, that's funny.

00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:13.666
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:16.002
A pest-control company
has unveiled its annual list

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:21.340
of the rattiest cities,
and New York City ranks third.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:25.377
We came in third?
Who got -- Who got first place?

00:02:25.377 --> 00:02:27.580
16th-century London?

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.616
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.616 --> 00:02:33.887
A new study suggests that the
moon is 40 million years older

00:02:33.887 --> 00:02:35.555
than scientists
previously believed.

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:38.691
Even crazier, John Stamos is 60.

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:40.293
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.494 --> 00:02:43.696
According to a new survey,

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.831
nearly 1 in 4 adults
feel lonely,

00:02:45.831 --> 00:02:48.134
and more often than not,
it's the drummer.

00:02:48.134 --> 00:02:50.436
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.773 --> 00:02:58.444
Traffic on a highway in England
recently came to a stop

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:01.314
after an escaped pack of llamas
and alpacas

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:02.615
wandered onto the road.

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:04.050
Said frustrated drivers,

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.152
"Which ones are which?"

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.954
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.756 --> 00:03:12.591
And finally,
according to a new book,

00:03:12.591 --> 00:03:15.394
McDonald's once tried to buy
the chain Panera Bread.

00:03:15.394 --> 00:03:18.965
Wow, she spilled the tea
about everyone in that memoir.

00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:20.733
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.804 --> 00:03:28.440
I told you that Panera thing
in confidence.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:29.675
That was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:29.675 --> 00:03:30.577
We're off and running.

